  "selection": [
    "First published 10 min file of each month from November 2019 through September 2020. In each six-hour UTC block take the first qualifying time index in each stability bin. Empty blocks or bins remain empty.",
    "Require wspd_vec_mean_*_qc=0 and wind_sector_qc_info_*=0 at all three levels, valid low eddy-covariance flux (turbulence_2m_qc=0) with ustar_2m at least 0.1 m/s, and lowest-level wind speed at least 2 m/s. Upper levels only enter eligibility via their metadata flags and presence.",
    "Use the instrument height_start and height_end metadata, requiring no height change during the evaluated day. Convert zeta_level_n_2m with the actual instrument height to L. Bins use the resulting uppermost z/L. Stable [0.05,0.5], unstable [-0.5,-0.05] and near-neutral |z/L| <= 0.02."
